<view class="page"><view class="card" wx:if="{{loggedIn}}"><image wx:if="{{avatarUrl}}" class="profile-avatar" src="{{avatarUrl}}" mode="aspectFill"/><view wx:else class="profile-avatar avatar-default">头像</view><view class="title">{{nickname}}</view><text class="tag">{{roleText}}</text><view class="hint" wx:if="{{me}}">{{me.mobile}}</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button class="secondary" wx:if="{{error}}" bindtap="load" disabled="{{loading}}">重新读取资料</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="profile" disabled="{{loading}}">账号资料 · 头像 / 昵称 / 手机号</button><view class="hint">下单前须绑定手机号并保存昵称；头像可保留默认。配送联系人电话仍需在订单表单填写。</view></view><view class="card" wx:else><view class="title">您好，欢迎来到飞毛腿</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">登录 / 注册</button></view>
<view class="card"><view class="title">我的服务</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="address">地址簿管理</button><button wx:if="{{isRider}}" class="primary" bindtap="workbench">进入骑手工作台</button><button wx:else class="secondary" bindtap="rider">申请骑手入驻</button></view>
<view class="card"><button class="secondary" bindtap="settings">服务连接设置</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="privacy">隐私与使用说明</button><button class="danger" wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" bindtap="logout" disabled="{{loading}}">退出登录</button><view class="hint">原生微信小程序 · 支付为 MOCK 演示；支持主动上传头像；未接入真实支付、送达照片凭证或 OCR。短信登录仍为演示，生产须接入真实短信或禁用入口。</view></view>
</view>
